    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41310" root="همر" body-key="h">
    
      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انهمر</span></b>  <i>It poured; poured out</i> or <i>forth;</i> (K;)
said of rain, and of tears; (TA;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَمَرَ</span></b> ,
(K,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَمِرَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُمُورٌ</span>; (TA;) [and so, app.,
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اهتمر</span></b> , q. v.:] <i>it flowed;</i> said of water, (S, K,)
of rain, and of tears; like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انهمل</span>: (TA:) and
in like manner, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَيْنُهُ بِالدَّمْعِ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَمَرَتْ</span></b>  <i>His eye
flowed with tears;</i> as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَمَلَتْ</span>. (A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انهمر بالكلام</span>: see 1.

